<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$90 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$90 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market saw four issuers sell a total of A$90 million worth of promissory notes via tender on Monday.</p>
<p>State-owned telecommunications group, Telstra Corp, made the largest issue on the day, selling A$20 million parcels of early December and early January-dated notes at about one basis point over their corresponding bank bill mid-rates.</p>
